Package: backuppc-client
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Alexander Musikhin <dth.pto@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: adduser, iproute2
Recommends: systemd-resolved, nftables
Section: net
Priority: optional
Description: headless client for the xray-backuppc tunnel
 Xray core with the native backuppc outbound plus a small configurator.
 Imports a backuppc:// link from the server panel and runs either as a
 local SOCKS5 proxy (backuppc-client.service) or as a system-wide VPN
 over a TUN interface (backuppc-client-tun.service).
